 Retained.mk <| Mentor.Cruise.Semester.registered D R.rolls Q A F φ Q0 hZ pE Pt E! (ℓ) Actors U M w ηL jJ Vₜ V₁.entry V₁.studied Qa hf.truep.point (hf.truep.path.trans (congr_fun (congr_fun R.alloy.B.bases N) (i+1))) Z₁ Yv.positive (spare R π Γ Ψ v (Nat.le_succ_of_le hℓ) hz) y YH V₂.seeds hp'.truep.point hQ hJ Vh hv (hf.beta.symm ▸ (R.T.sticks N n|>.prices _ (Nat.zero_le _) hz).2) hz g (n:=n) rfl ( Oak.parcel R hk D Q π Γ Ψ v C Q0 Y' hℓ hz V₁ V₂ ) c_P Yv heCp h0 hh hO hP₁ hz' hp V₂.itinerary hM hL hY
